  "stem": "The function \\(f\\) is defined by \\(f(x) = a(b)^{x}\\), where \\(a\\) and \\(b\\) are positive constants. The table shows two values of \\(f(x)\\). What is the value of \\(b\\)?",
  "figure": {
    "kind": "table",
    "columns": [
      "x",
      "f(x)"
    ],
    "rows": [
      [
        "0",
        "125"
